	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c08r0202_babyboy2_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>マネッコは　ボクじゃないよ
でも　マネッコは　おもしろいよ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-27T09:24:42" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-27T06:37:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>マネッコは　ボクじゃないよ
でも　マネッコは　おもしろいよ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-27T09:24:45" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-27T07:57:51" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・クイズをしていないとき</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-27T06:36:44" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>BABYBOY</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-16T06:33:12" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>C</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-11T11:47:09" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c08r0202_babygirl1_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あたしね　じぶんの
おりじなりてぃを　だいじにしたいの</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-27T06:37:32" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-27T06:37:21" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あたしね　じぶんの
おりじなりてぃを　だいじにしたいの</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-27T07:57:51" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-27T07:57:51" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・クイズをしていないとき</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-27T06:36:47" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>BABYBOY</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-16T06:33:14" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>C</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-11T11:47:09" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c08r0202_babygirl2_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>だれかの　まねを　するよりも
まねを　されるほうが　ステキ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-27T09:27:54" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-27T07:57:25" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>だれかの　まねを　するよりも
まねを　されるほうが　ステキ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-27T09:27:59" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-27T07:57:34" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・クイズをしていないとき</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-27T06:36:49" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>BABYBOY</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-16T06:33:14" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>C</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-11T11:47:09" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c08r0202_breederm_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あいてが　さいごに　つかった
わざを　せんとうの　あいだ▼
じぶんの　わざに　できる
それが　ものまね！　そして▼
ものまねの　わざを　おぼえなくても
おれの　デンチュラは　チャーミング！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-27T08:06:44" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-27T06:46:51" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>相手が　最後に　使った
技を　戦闘の　あいだ▼
自分の　技に　できる
それが　ものまね！　そして▼
ものまねの　技を　覚えなくても
おれの　デンチュラは　チャーミング！</Text>
